// NOTE: libdrm is NOT declared here.
// external/libdrm/Android.bp has vendor_available: true — the AOSP-built
// libdrm is accessible to vendor processes. A vendor prebuilt with the same
// module name would be silently dropped by Soong (duplicate module). The
// AOSP copy is used automatically; no action needed here.
